      "width": 400,
      "height": 24,
      "text": "V6 KEY CHANGES FROM V5:",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-content",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 895,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "1. COLOR SIMPLIFICATION: Stories = Blue (#eff6ff bg, #3b82f6 border) | Points = Gray/Muted (#f5f5f5 bg, #d1d5db border)\n   - Follows /live message bubble pattern: YOUR stuff (stories) = primary color, OTHERS' stuff (debatable points) = muted\n   - Removed yellow entirely - was too colorful and points have no owner anyway\n   - Blue reserved for: Stories, interactive elements (selected options, CTAs), and progress indicators\n\n2. TEXT BADGES INSTEAD OF EMOJI: \"STORY\" and \"POINT\" in caps text instead of 💭/🟡 emoji (more accessible)\n\n3. ADDED SCREEN 3.5 (DASHBOARD): Shows what was found before review starts (from user's sketch)\n   - Tap any item to review or reject\n   - \"Publish (0 ready)\" button disabled until items reviewed\n\n4. POINT REJECTION FLOW: Screen 5 shows user rejecting Point 2 with 8/10 rating and explanation\n   - Yellow warning box explains why they're rejecting\n   - \"Reject point\" button (not red - just outlined)\n\n5. SAME SEQUENTIAL FLOW: Entry → Processing → Story Review → Point 1 → Point 2 (reject) → Publish\n   - All key patterns from V5 preserved: JourneyToUnderstanding card, A/B/C/D options, 10/10 gates\n\n6. FINAL SUMMARY: Screen 6 shows 1 Story (blue), 1 Point accepted (gray), 1 Point rejected (gray faded + strikethrough)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid"
    }
  ],
